  "stateRateSource": "Not computed: NT total 31,441 offences (12,595 against the person + 18,846 property) in 12 months to Jan 2026 per same Table 3; NT population could not be fetched (rate-limited) so rate left null. With 2021 census NT population it can be derived as 31441/pop*1000.",
  "notes": "NT publishes crime only by police reporting region (Darwin, Palmerston, Alice Springs, Katherine, Tennant Creek, Nhulunbuy, NT Balance); no suburb-level counts. Darwin region = urban area from Buffalo Creek, Berrimah and East Arm westwards. Every Darwin suburb carries the whole Darwin-region totals and every Palmerston suburb the whole Palmerston-region totals. offences = person + property (the only two groups in the NT series; excludes drug, public order, traffic etc.). Region populations were not fetched (WebFetch rate-limited), so population is null; suggested ABS 2021 census: City of Darwin LGA (LGA71000) and City of Palmerston LGA (LGA72800). Newer monthly publications (to July 2026) exist but their PDFs could not be reached. Howard Springs and Humpty Doo are in 'NT Balance' (mostly remote NT) so region figures are not used; crime null."
